    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1054587\">Bin Dong</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/Comparing.20functions.20as.20relations.20with.20ordinary.20functions/near/579690200\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The first one has proved to be tricky. I have accomplished this goal, but my main question is, can the first of these three (get value from relation) be defined in a way which is constructive?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This is not possible, because <code>function_relation</code> holds no data.</p>",
